          ],
          "correctIndex": 0
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Drivers may transport vulnerable passengers and come into contact with people at risk; safeguarding awareness is essential",
      "id": "s-db-0004"
    },
    {
      "type": "dropdown_blanks",
      "template": "You must report any incident, accident or {{0}} to TfL within {{1}} hours",
