        "Continue working without it",
        "Report it to TfL and apply for a replacement",
        "Borrow another driver's disc"
      ],
      "correctAnswer": 2,
      "explanation": "A lost or stolen disc must be reported to TfL and a replacement obtained before continuing to work",
      "id": "s-mc-0005"
    },
